<title>USA: CENTENNIAL UPS SHR BUYBACK TO 3 MLN SHRS.</title>
<headline>CENTENNIAL UPS SHR BUYBACK TO 3 MLN SHRS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW CANAAN, Conn. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centennial Cellular Corp said Wednesday its board of directors authorized buying back up to three million shares of its class A common stock.</p>
<p>The cellular telephone company said it bought back 244,000 shares under its previous one-million share buyback program through August 1.</p>
<p>Centennial added it will buy back the shares in the open market or in privately-negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>The company's stock rose 1-1/4 to 17-1/8 Wednesday afternoon.</p>
</text>
